-- The flat pattern poster in plain English: no loops, and the order of the sentences does not matter.
Let there be a flat canvas called pattern, 1080 by 1350.
Let navy be #1f3a5f.
Let ember be #e4572e.

Let there be 9 circles called orbit, at 540 560, the first 70 big, each 70 bigger than the last, hollow 6.
Let there be 12 triangles called ray, 46 by 150, in a ring around 540 560, 450 out.
Let there be a circle called core, 150 big, at 540 560.
Write "RADIAL" called title in Big Shoulders Display bold, at 540 1150, fit 860.
Write "drawn in plain English" called sub in Jost, at 540 1240, size 40, tracking 6.

Make the card #f4efe6, vignetted 0.35, in navy.
Make the orbits navy, 30% see-through.
Make the rays ember.
Make the third ray navy.
Make the core a radial gradient from #ffd166 to #e4572e, feathered 6.
Make the title navy.
Make the sub ember.
